# Git at the end of each step

When a Hexlet course step in this repo is finished, commit the relevant files and push to `origin` on the current branch. Do not wait for the user to ask.

Commit messages follow Conventional Commits, including agent commits: `feat:`, `fix:`, `docs:`, `ci:`, `chore:`, `test:`. See `docs/commits.md`.

Do not commit secrets, `node_modules`, or build artifacts (`dist`).
